      "title": "Learning What to Forget: Improving LLM Unlearning via Learned Token-Level Importance",
      "title_zh": "学习遗忘什么：通过学习token级重要性提升大语言模型遗忘",
      "authors": [
        "Gizem Yüce",
        "Giorgos Nikolaou",
        "Nicolas Flammarion"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.06320v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.06320v1",
