      "id": "2606.06820",
      "direction_id": "agent-skills-harness",
      "direction_name": "Agent Skills 与 Harness",
      "week": "2026-W24",
      "title": "SCALE: Scalable Cross-Attention Learning with Extrapolation for Agentic Workflow Scheduling",
      "title_zh": "SCALE：面向智能体工作流调度的可扩展带外推交叉注意力学习",
      "authors": [
        "Zhifei Xu",
        "Jierui Lan",
        "Zixuan Liang",
        "Aiji Liang",
        "Jinxi He"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.06820v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.06820v1",
      "category": "cs.LG",
      "published": "2026-06-05 01:45:02+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-06-08",
      "abstract": "Agentic Large Language Model (LLM) systems decompose complex tasks into workflow Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs) whose primitives must be scheduled on heterogeneous clusters. Existing deep reinforcement learning (DRL) schedulers are tied to a fixed cluster size and require retraining whenever the number of servers changes. We propose SCALE (Scalable Cross-Attention Learning with Extrapolation), a DRL scheduler that generalizes to unseen cluster scales without fine-tuning. SCALE employs a cross-attention pointer network where task features query against server features, so the architecture accepts any number of servers by construction. We observe, however, that permutation-invariant architecture alone does not guarantee good performance at new scales - the attention feature undergoes distribution shift as the server count grows. To counter this, we introduce Structured Representation Regularization (SRR): a decorrelation loss combined with a KL penalty toward the standard normal, which keeps feature statistics stable regardless of input size. Trained on 16 nodes and tested directly on 32 and 48 nodes, SCALE reduces average response time by 8.9% at N=48 relative to the same architecture without SRR, confirming that explicit regularization is necessary to close the scale-generalization gap.",
      "abstract_zh": "智能体大语言模型系统会将复杂任务分解为工作流有向无环图（DAG），其基础单元需要在异构集群上调度。现有深度强化学习（DRL）调度器绑定固定集群规模，服务器数量变化时必须重新训练。本文提出SCALE，一种无需微调即可泛化到未知集群规模的DRL调度器，采用交叉注意力指针网络，引入结构化表示正则化SRR稳定特征统计。在16节点训练、48节点测试时，相对无SRR的同架构平均响应时间降低8.9%。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "现有DRL智能体工作流调度器绑定固定集群规模，服务器数变化需重训，仅排列不变架构无法保证新规模性能。",
      "method": "提出DRL调度器SCALE，采用可适配任意服务器数的交叉注意力指针网络，引入SRR正则化稳定特征统计。",
      "contribution": "提出可泛化到未知规模集群的调度器，解决规模变化带来的特征分布偏移问题，实验验证性能提升8.9%。",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "仅排列不变架构无法保证新集群规模下的性能，加入SRR后48节点测试相对原架构平均响应时间降低8.9%。",
      "theme": "智能体工作流调度",
      "method_family": "policy optimization",
      "cross_direction": "not-crossing",
      "edit_target": "工作流",
      "agent_setting": "智能体工作流调度",
      "control_mechanism": "通过结构化表示正则化稳定不同集群规模下的注意力特征统计，提升调度器的规模泛化能力。",
      "evaluation_environment": "不同规模异构集群，评测指标为平均响应时间",
      "evaluation_signal": "16节点训练直接测试48节点，SCALE相对无SRR的同架构将平均响应时间降低了8.9%。",
      "failure_mode": "原有调度器无法适配动态变化的集群规模，新规模下注意力特征分布偏移导致性能下降。",
      "reliability_risk": "仅在模拟节点环境验证，未在真实工业大规模集群测试，实际可用性待进一步验证。",
      "industrial_relevance": "high",
      "idea_feasibility": "high",
      "compute_cost": "low",
      "idea_hook": "可将这种规模泛化的正则化思路迁移到开放环境多工具调用的工作流调度agent harness中。",
      "mentor_question": "这种规模泛化的正则化方法能不能迁移到我们研究的开放智能体工作流调度场景？",
      "read_priority": "medium",
      "direction_fit": "研究智能体工作流调度的规模泛化，符合工业友好路线，对本方向有一定参考价值。",
