      "title": "MADRAG: Multi-Agent Debate with Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Training-Free Analytic Essay Scoring",
      "title_zh": "MADRAG：面向无训练分析性作文评分的检索增强多智能体辩论框架",
      "authors": [
        "Ali Keramati",
        "Shiyuan Zhou",
        "Sharad Mehrotra",
        "Mark Warschauer"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.06754v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.06754v1",
